<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est 100,000, Wk ago 92,000, and Yr ago 94,000. Saturday's 15,000, 19,000, and 25,000 head. Estimates include generally about 60 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded $0.50 lower than mid-session Thursday. Trade was slow for light to moderate demand and offerings. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
